{"id": "60094", "title": "风暖雨花台", "author": "八爪南宫", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 16, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/60/60094.htm", "intro": "属性分类：古代／其他／一般言情／喜剧\r\n关键字：禾风暖 　配角 　其他 \r\n他是大盛皇朝帝王，他心里只有霸业天下，没有温婉柔情。\r\n他是最受皇帝信任的骁将，伴随帝王纵横江山。他美艳倾城，身旁却只有爱妻为伴。\r\n禾风暖与将军年幼相识，少年夫妻，恩爱不比寻常。\r\n然而，皇帝要的不仅是万里河山，他还想要这将军的爱妻，美人将身归何处？", "base": "files/article/html/60/60094", "chapters": [{"title": "1", "file": "8806538.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "8806541.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3", "file": "8806543.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4", "file": "8806545.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5", "file": "8806548.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6", "file": "8806549.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7", "file": "8806550.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8", "file": "8806551.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9", "file": "8806555.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10", "file": "8806557.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11", "file": "8806559.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12", "file": "8806562.html", "available": false}, {"title": "13", "file": "8806564.html", "available": false}, {"title": "14", "file": "8806566.html", "available": false}, {"title": "15", "file": "8806567.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16", "file": "8806568.html", "available": false}]}